5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I worry the old three-person split is unfair now that we are five.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual numbers before agreeing to any new split.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate that someone always ends up doing the math. I want to know how many hours this actually takes each month!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I am tired of the rumor that one of us is subsidizing the others. I want to verify if the current split is actually lopsided.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned that the tension around money is damaging our relationships. I want to see how the current split has affected our interactions.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I agree, the numbers are key. But I also worry about the winter heating costs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, winter is exactly when the gap widens. I need to see the seasonal variance in the data.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, winter is brutal! But if the math takes hours, I refuse to be the one doing it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the math is trivial. The real issue is whether the current split matches actual usage. I will verify that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, the math is easy, but the silence after a reminder is not. I need to see if the tension is real.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I feel that too. I want us to be comfortable, not just calculating. Let’s find a way that feels warm.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, I understand the social strain. But I cannot fix feelings without fixing the underlying financial discrepancy first.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the math is trivial, why does it take so long? I need to know the real time cost, not just the numbers!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, it takes long because nobody trusts the result. I will check the plug-in monitor readings to prove who is actually using what.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the time is less the issue than the trust. I will look into the payment log to see if the friction is in the process.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
