35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, the south rooms stay warm naturally, but the others need heat from November. That gap is huge.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, that seasonal swing explains the volatility. I found February hit 29,400 yen, while August was only 9,100.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, the template meant keying in every invoice by hand! That is hours of work. I refuse to be the one doing that every month.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the template is a band-aid. I found the usage gap is four-to-one. Sub-meters cost 34,000 yen per room, but that is the only honest fix.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the payment log shows three months settled late, always after someone questioned the amount. The friction is real, not imagined.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, four-to-one is shocking. But 34,000 yen per room is a massive upfront cost. Can we really afford that right now?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I agree. The upfront cost is significant. I need to know if the savings justify that investment before we commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, forty minutes at the other house is manageable! If we automate the logging, I can handle it without losing my evenings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, forty minutes is fine if the data is accurate. My monitors prove the usage gap is real, not a feeling. We need precision, not just speed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, forty minutes is good, but the cooler notice stayed up all summer. People avoided the bill to avoid the argument.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that silence is exactly what I fear. I want a system where we don’t have to guess or argue.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, that silence confirms the current method is broken. I need to know if the volatility I see in the statements makes a fixed split impossible.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, the volatility is real, but if the template is automated, I only need to check the final numbers. That saves my evenings!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the volatility is irrelevant if the split is wrong. The monitors show who actually uses power. We need to stop guessing and start measuring.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, precision is good, but if it creates more silence, it fails. I need a method that keeps us talking, not just measuring.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I hear you, but I worry about the cost. @Ryuji, what if we just split the winter heating fairly?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, a fixed winter split ignores the four-to-one usage gap. I need to see if the sub-meter cost is recoverable within a year.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the monitors are already there, why do we need the expensive sub-meters? I just want to know who is actually using the power!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the monitors are temporary. Sub-meters are permanent. I will check the electrician’s quote to see if the annual check is worth the wiring hassle.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the monitors are temporary, but the silence is permanent. I need a method that prevents the avoidance, not just the measurement.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
